Package: linux-image-5.4.233-microsoft-lahaina
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux kernel for Surface Duo 2
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the Surface Duo 2 device.
 .
 Note: This package only ships the kernel image and modules, you should probably
 look at the linux-bootimage-5.4.233-microsoft-lahaina package for a bootimage suitable
 for Android boot loaders.

Package: linux-bootimage-5.4.233-microsoft-lahaina
