Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         linux-image-5.4.233-microsoft-lahaina (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Linux kernel for Surface Duo 2 - Android Boot Image
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the Surface Duo 2 device.
 .
 Note: This package ships an Android Boot Image bundled with Halium's
 initramfs.

